export anchor AubergineStyle:
    number: 235
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Aubergine
    idea:
        A plush plum workspace of rounded capsules, with a violet hero that
        holds the greeting and four pill figures, projects as rows with
        segmented pill meters, and rose as the single warm accent.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #1a1020, the page and the style sheet
        plum: #221528, the top bar
        skin: #2a1a31, panels and project rows
        flesh: #36223f, pill figures, the search field, empty meter segments and the current nav pill
        heroTop: #3b2449, the top of the hero gradient
        line: #4d3557, panel borders and row dividers
        ink: #f3e8f5, text and figures
        mauve: #c9b2cf, meta, labels and axis text
        violet: #b9a0ec, last week capsules, category bubbles and secondary outlines
        rose: #f4a3c0, the primary button, filled meter segments, this week capsules, links and focus
        roseInk: #2b0f1d, text on rose
        ok: #93e0c0, On track text and check circle
        risk: #f3d27a, At risk text and triangle
        bad: #ffab91, Behind and overdue text, crossed square and clock
    type:
        One geometric stack, Avenir Next, Century Gothic, Futura, URW Gothic,
        Trebuchet MS, sans-serif. Base 14px at 1.5. The greeting is 40px at
        700, pill figures 32px at 700 with tabular numbers, panel titles 20px
        at 700, project names 16px at 600, meta 13px in mauve, and nav pills
        14px at 600.
    layout:
        A plum top bar holds a rose round mark with the Brightwork name, the
        six nav links as pills with Home filled, a pill search field, a round
        bell, a rose New project pill and Mara Okafor with a round initials
        disc. Under it a wide hero capsule with 28px corners fades from violet
        plum at top to the panel colour. Its left side holds Hello, Mara, the
        date and a rounded overdue pill reading 4 tasks are overdue with a
        clock. Its right side holds the four figures as a two by two grid of
        pill capsules, each a large number beside a short label. Below, two
        columns. The wide left panel lists the six projects as rows with a
        round violet category bubble showing the first letter, the name and
        category, a status pill, a ten segment pill meter with the percent,
        tasks done and the due date. The narrow right column holds the chart
        as paired capsules by weekday, last week violet outlines and this week
        rose fills with totals, then the activity as rows with round initials.
        Below 980px the columns stack, below 640px the nav pills wrap and
        project rows reflow into two lines.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px panel padding, 16px row padding, 24px between panels.
    density: Medium. Generous hero, compact project rows.
    corners:
        Very round. 28px hero, 22px panels, pills on every button, field,
        chip, meter and bar.
    borders: 1px line on panels and between rows. Last week capsules are 2px violet outlines.
    shadows:
        A soft plum glow under the hero, 0 16px 40px of near-black at 45
        percent, none elsewhere.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 1.8px stroke. Status uses a check circle, a
        triangle with a bang and a crossed square inside a pill with the word,
        overdue a clock.
    focus: A 2px rose outline offset 3px.
    tone: Warm and personal, such as Hello, Mara and This week feels busier.
